  "label": "Sexual Assault Allegations Against Brett Kavanaugh",
  "description": "In 2018, during the confirmation hearings for Brett Kavanaugh's appointment to the Supreme Court, multiple women came forward with allegations of sexual assault and misconduct against him. These allegations were central to the political and public discourse surrounding his nomination. The meme references these allegations by using the phrase 'grabbed my penis,' which is a vulgar and crude way to refer to sexual assault, implying that Kavanaugh is a figure of predatory or inappropriate behavior.",
